@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 180
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

title Activity: Automation - Run Test

|Tester|
start
:Click "Run Test" button;
:Select Headless (true/false);

|Frontend|
:POST /api/automation/test-cases/{id}/run {headless};

|Backend|
:AutomationService.run(testCaseId, {headless});
:loadRunConfig(testCaseId);
:Get Stored Script from automation_scripts;
:Create temp script file;
:Spawn Playwright Process (npx playwright test);
:PlaywrightScriptService.generatePlaywrightScript();
:Helper functions (__log, __step, __healed, __makeLocator, __findElement, __verifyText, __clickElement, __fillElement, __goto, __settle, __capture, __waitForFinalState);

|Playwright|
:Launch browser (Chromium/Firefox/WebKit);
:Create context (viewport, deviceScaleFactor);
:Create page;
:Set default timeout;
:Execute test steps sequentially;
:__step(n, fn) wraps each step in try/catch;
:Log progress (LOG:INFO/STEP/ERROR);
:__goto(page, url) handles navigation with retry;
:__findElement tries multiple locator strategies;
:__verifyText confirms expected results;
:Capture screenshots (per config);
:Capture video/trace (if enabled);

|Backend|
:Stream logs to ExecutionLog table;
:Capture artifacts (screenshots, video, trace);
:On completion: Update Execution (status, duration, artifacts);
:Update TestCase lastExecutionStatus + lastExecutedAt;

|Frontend|
:Poll execution status;
:Show real-time logs;
:Display result (PASSED/FAILED/ERROR);
:Show artifacts (screenshots, video, trace);

stop

@enduml